<item><title>Burkina Faso motorcycle tour brings more than 300 riders across eight regions</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-motorcycle-tour-brings-more-than-300-riders-498212/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-motorcycle-tour-brings-more-than-300-riders-498212/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The second edition ended in Ouagadougou on Saturday, 21 November 2026, after riders covered more than 1 800 kilometres in eight days.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:43:13 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso trains 99 military retirees in farming and livestock</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-trains-99-military-retirees-in-farming-and-859388/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-trains-99-military-retirees-in-farming-and-859388/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The three-week course in Ouagadougou covered crop production, animal care and farm management for personnel preparing to leave service.</description><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 08:38:40 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso records 956 cybercrime victims and CFA261 million in losses</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-records-956-cybercrime-victims-and-cfa261-33f4bc/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-records-956-cybercrime-victims-and-cfa261-33f4bc/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Mobile Money scams accounted for 263 victims and more than CFA104 million stolen during October, according to security officials.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:55:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso orders market checks after Ouagadougou fire</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-orders-market-checks-after-ouagadougou-fire-c24d6a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-orders-market-checks-after-ouagadougou-fire-c24d6a/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>Security Minister Mahamadou Sana said the 19 November blaze was linked to insecticides that may have been poorly packaged, not explosives.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:41:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-orders-market-checks-after-ouagadougou-fire-c24d6a/share.jpg" length="41032" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-orders-market-checks-after-ouagadougou-fire-c24d6a/share.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Burkina Faso starts paving 61-kilometre road to Ivorian border</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-starts-paving-61-kilometre-road-to-ivorian-16a468/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/bf/burkina-faso-starts-paving-61-kilometre-road-to-ivorian-16a468/</guid><category>Burkina Faso</category><description>The RN11 extension will link Batié and Kpuéré to the border, with state funding and work divided between a public agency and private firms.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 21:11:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" length="35711" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/bf.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
